From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 16:23:31 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Language packs: the texts of this rung in all 25 languages
 (102.8 line)

- New and reworded strings for guest network pairs, SNMP access from the WAN, the VPN target
  states, WireGuard peers and port clashes, Wake on LAN, the IPv6 prefix length, Access
  Restrictions and the connection limit help (its default is the maximum).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
